      "content": "It sounds exhausting to feel like you've been fighting a battle with no clear victory, and that deep exhaustion is completely valid. Please know that the value of your life is inherent, separate from job titles, material possessions, or relationships. If you are feeling overwhelmed and unable to continue, please seek immediate support by calling or texting 988 in the US/Canada; there are people available right now to sit with you in this darkness.",
